Amulet's of magical breathing are the rarest of the amulets (aside
from Yendor), but that's not really all that rare.  7% of all 
random amulets are magical breathing.  The trouble with them is that
they're pretty tough to identify without using an identify scroll.
(You've probably had one a few times, and not known it).

If you're interested, the probabilities are:
   ESP 18%
   Versus Poison 17%
   Strangulation 14%
   Restful Sleep 14%
   Change 14%
   Life Saving 8%
   Reflection 8%
   Magical Breathing 7%

